<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the Digimon Master Online game with auto farm with some tweek

Setting:
Full Screen 1920x1080
attack shortcut is Q

line 1 for find digimon
line 7 for check digimon health
line 16 for check if target digimon die or not</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>GoColor 3 3 129,34,24 236,78,59 2 970 56 4 7 1 0
Goto 7
KeyDown 43 1
Delay 50 100 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 50 ms
GoColor 13 2 129,34,24 236,78,59 2 970 56 4 7 1 0
KeyDown 43 1
Delay 50 100 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 50 ms
Goto 7
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 100 300 ms
KeyUp 20 1
GoColor 18 2 129,34,24 236,78,59 2 829 56 1 7 1 0
Goto 19
GoWhile 16 86400000
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Digimon Masters Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>